# BscScan

> BscScan is a Block Explorer and Analytics Platform for BNB Smart Chain, an EVM-compatible blockchain network.

## Main Pages
- [Home](https://bscscan.com/) - Main landing page of BscScan with an overview of the BNB Smart Chain blockchain.

## Blockchain
- [Transactions](https://bscscan.com/txs) - Live feed of transactions with sender, recipient, value, fees, block linkage, and status.
- [Transaction Details](https://bscscan.com/tx/<transactionhash>) - Full metadata for a transaction, including status, participants, value, gas, contract interactions, transfers, logs, and decoded input. Replace `<transactionhash>` with a transaction hash.
- [Pending Transactions](https://bscscan.com/txsPending) - Live feed of pending transactions, including nonce, gas price, sender, recipient, and time last seen.
- [Internal Transactions](https://bscscan.com/txsInternal) - Internal contract calls with call type, participants, value, and parent transaction context.
- [Blocks](https://bscscan.com/blocks) - Recent BNB Smart Chain blocks with transaction counts, gas metrics, validators or miners, rewards, and timestamps.
- [Block Details](https://bscscan.com/block/<blockNumber>) - Full metadata for a block. Replace `<blockNumber>` with a block height.
- [Address](https://bscscan.com/address/<address>) - Address balances, token holdings, transactions, internal transfers, NFT activity, and contract data. Replace `<address>` with an address.
- [Verified Contracts](https://bscscan.com/contractsVerified) - Latest verified contracts with source code, compiler, verification date, license, and audit metadata.
- [Gas Tracker](https://bscscan.com/gastracker) - Current gas prices, network utilization, estimated transaction costs, and gas usage statistics.

## Tokens & NFTs
- [Tokens](https://bscscan.com/tokens) - Directory of fungible tokens with price, volume, market cap, supply, and holder data.
- [Token Transfers](https://bscscan.com/tokentxns) - Latest fungible-token transfers with participants, token, amount, block, and transaction hash.
- [Token or NFT Details](https://bscscan.com/token/<contractAddress>) - Metadata, holders, transfers, contract information, and market activity. Replace `<contractAddress>` with the token contract.
- [Top NFTs](https://bscscan.com/nft-top-contracts) - Ranked NFT collections with volume, sales, floor price, ownership, and transfer activity.
- [NFT Transfers](https://bscscan.com/nft-transfers) - Latest ERC-721 and ERC-1155 transfers.
- [NFT Item](https://bscscan.com/nft/<contractAddress>/<tokenId>) - Metadata and history for an individual NFT. Replace the placeholders with the collection contract and token ID.

